        <mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;i&gt;The work, the needs and the class time are the rows of the Teaching approaches table. Plan A, Plan B and Plan C are the plans in the same section. Scope 3 asks for 45 to 60 minutes of student time outside the class as well.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="472" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
